    "commit_body": "F2: SPY weekly composite look-ahead removed \u00e2\u20ac\u201d _spy_wk_last_completed() (-7d,\n    last-completed-week) at ALL per-date sites (single-row, mis-stress map,\n    reapply_regime_today, batched, recalc) + simulator map. v69 leak class.\nF4: point-in-time mcap proxy (mcap_t = mcap_latest * close_t / latest_close)\n    in all scoring paths \u00e2\u20ac\u201d kills the grown-into-large-cap survivorship leak.\nF1: sector Market Wave loud inert/stale guards + self-contained source\n    rebuilder (the v57 source CSV silently vanished; wave was inert in all\n    v60/v69/v70 row sets).\nF3: continuation-echo barrier-cache coverage guard (cache was truncated to\n    117 days; rebuilt to 2016-04-26..2026-06-09 via queue #101).\n\nRetirements (honest 5y full-universe A/B, option barrier, bias-to-retire):\n- mis_stress (MIS_STRESS_CALL_DAMPEN=0): 75+ admits below baseline\n  (50.7 vs 55.2, z=-1.03); original evidence was leak-measured.\n- JA4 put-regime blend (_JA4_SPY_WK_WEIGHT=0): wash at <=25, mildly negative\n  at <=30 (z=-2.48); puts OFF portfolio-wide; removes sim/prod divergence.\n- MCD (MCD_ENABLED=False): PIT ladder collapses 8.2pp->2.6pp z=+2.61 (<W1 3),\n  non-monotonic; removals near-baseline (53.0 vs 55.0); ~42% of 75+ N freed.\n- Sector Market Wave (SECTOR_BREADTH_WAVE_ENABLED=False): formal retirement \u00e2\u20ac\u201d\n  inert all era; rebuilt-source A/B removes ABOVE-baseline winners (-28% 75+ N).\n\nBundle (= this ship state) vs stored v70: 75+ supply +49% at FLAT honest WR,\nputs unchanged, gradient intact. Validation: legacy arm reproduces stored v70\nat 98.43% exact (936,580 rows). Evidence: experiments/integrity_audit_2026_06/\n(FINDINGS.md, ab_eval.py, analyze_ab.py); regression tests\ntests/test_integrity_guards.py (24 green). Adversarial review: 0 blockers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
    "commit_short": "04044b21b",
